{"overview":"پس از یک نامزدی ناموفق، لو متوجه می‌شود که در نوشتن سوگندهای عروسی دیگران استعداد دارد؛ این خبر در میان مراسم عروسی شیکاگو پخش می‌شود و خدمات او پرتقاضا می‌شود؛ حتی یک هوادار جدید به نام دش پیدا می‌کند؛ اما همه چیز وقتی از او خواسته می‌شود سوگندهای عروسی اولیویا را که با وارِن، عشق دوران دانشگاهی لو، ازدواج می‌کند، می‌نویسد، تغییر می‌کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Following a failed engagement, Lou discovers she has a talent for writing other people’s wedding vows. Word spreads across Chicago’s wedding scene and Lou’s services are in high demand. She even has a new admirer in Dash. But everything changes when she’s asked to write vows for Olivia, who’s marrying Warren, Lou’s old college flame.","tagline_en":"","runtime":104,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Joey Power"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"کلوئی گریس مورتز","role":"Lou","photo":"/yq4rYmaTRC5degaOYmJQFpaiho1.jpg","en":"Chloë Grace Moretz"},{"name":"آنتونی راموس","role":"Dash","photo":"/gCeRfH3aetIpZwKxe8Wl4ZYcQg5.jpg","en":"Anthony Ramos"},{"name":"منی جاسینتو","role":"Warren","photo":"/jMbNV4nr5647r6CZJbT6nsnspMz.jpg","en":"Manny Jacinto"},{"name":"Isabel May","role":"Olivia","photo":"/RJ4djIbfvUHXCCgniiAi0ebhED.jpg"},{"name":"Lukas Gage","role":"Gus","photo":"/xXknCnXtRBmqg38TkMuPFtugt5s.jpg"},{"name":"Billie Lourd","role":"Tilda","photo":"/1u8bZL6ZXu5iDbPO3Z0Spetyt34.jpg"},{"name":"کلوئه فاینمن","role":"Marion","photo":"/pzGIb2jkjeXGhOJryPf2n2w13lI.jpg","en":"Chloe Fineman"},{"name":"Bobbi Althoff","role":"Genji","photo":"/3paiMEXfQXBsEWLbo44K3GKeoP4.jpg"},{"name":"Morgan Jay","role":"Ufberg","photo":"/bOpIClFXHFtUp9W1QDwzHzGIX6K.jpg"},{"name":"Dan Perrault","role":"Jeff","photo":"/pVr6MffUwxBYv5XKLNAJdvRFa5A.jpg"},{"name":"Zach Zucker","role":"Teddy","photo":"/9HW7NgMemxjsijN575m1mNlSmc5.jpg"},{"name":"Marchánt Davis","role":"Steven","photo":"/3EVEDzMaUqaZ5QKuclsT5kH9jfm.jpg"}],"trailer":"hrXydegMePY","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themovied